---

<EventPageLayout
  lang={lang}
  pageKey="capodanno-sorrento"
  metaTitle={"New Year's Eve Sorrento 2027: Programme, Piazza Tasso, Fireworks"}
  metaDescription={"New Year's Eve in Sorrento on 31 December 2026: the end of year concert at Teatro Tasso, the Ciuccio di Fuoco in Piazza Tasso, music until 3am and fireworks from Marina Piccola."}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  hero={hero}
  schema={schema}
  facts={facts}
  transport={transport}
  slider={slider}
  relatedEvents={relatedEvents}
  cta={cta}
>
  <p slot="intro">Sorrento is one of the few places on the coast that sees in the New Year outdoors, in the square, for free. The centre is pedestrian, the square is large and the bay provides the backdrop for the fireworks: for anyone who does not want to be shut inside a set dinner it is the simplest option on the Bay of Naples.</p>
  <p slot="intro">The programme has repeated the same shape for years: the end of year concert at Teatro Tasso late in the morning, a procession along Corso Italia with the folk group and the Canzone di Capodanno in the afternoon, the Ciuccio di Fuoco in Piazza Tasso at dusk, live music and DJ sets until 3am and fireworks from Marina Piccola. The official programme is published in the last days of December.</p>

  <div>
    <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">The traditions of the evening</h3>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
        <span class="text-med-gold text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 block">The tradition</span>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">The Ciuccio di Fuoco</h4>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">This is the moment locals wait for: a donkey figure loaded with fireworks that runs through the square among the crowd. It lasts a few minutes, happens in the late afternoon and is aimed above all at children.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
        <span class="text-med-gold text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 block">The music</span>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">From Teatro Tasso to the square</h4>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">The Società dei Concerti's end of year concert opens the day at Teatro Tasso. In the evening the square switches to live music and DJ sets, which carry on well past midnight.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</EventPageLayout>
